      "text": "Growth has not yet demonstrated consistent GAAP operating profitability. The same Q2 release reports adjusted EBITDA of $236.2 million alongside a $190.4 million loss from continuing operations for the quarter. FY2025 operating income was -$611.7 million on $529.8 million revenue; the period is stale relative to the November 2026 analysis date.",
