      "text": "Infrastructure financing is a material execution input. An October 22 filing describes a $3.5 billion senior secured term loan facility for GPU infrastructure and general corporate purposes, with maturity on October 16, 2027. The supplied filing does not establish whether or how much was drawn, nor current total debt or liquidity.",
