    {
      "text": "The market setup is volatile and recently weak despite a positive broad-market snapshot. NBIS was $143.995, down 5.04% on November 4, while SPY, QQQ, IWM, and DIA were each up; NBIS's November 3 close of $151.64 was below its 50-day average of $206.96 and 200-day average of $177.89. The close-based indicators are dated November 3, not the November 4 live quote.",
