      "text": "Valuation is difficult to anchor with the supplied evidence. The calculated EV/TTM revenue is 74.74x using $39.6 billion enterprise value and $529.8 million FY2025 revenue, but the valuation evidence explicitly says revenue multiples are not valid for this issuer and peer support is not meaningful. The EV combines a November 2026 market capitalization with December 2025 balance-sheet inputs.",
