      "text": "The supplied FY2025 SEC figures show $3.678 billion cash and $4.128 billion debt at December 31, 2025. These imply net debt of $449.6 million for that balance-sheet date, but do not establish present liquidity after the October 2026 facility; the valuation evidence withholds debt-to-market-cap and net-debt-to-market-cap because the balance-sheet inputs are stale.",
