      "text": "A near-term information catalyst is the provider-estimated November 12, 2026 earnings date; the issuer has not confirmed the date and timing is unknown. The provider lists EPS of -0.7021 and revenue of 924.1 million, but the revenue estimate's currency is undeclared. The event could update operating evidence, though the supplied calendar is not issuer guidance.",
