    {
      "text": "Bear case: growth and capacity expansion may fail to produce attractive returns if utilization, customer monetization, or financing economics disappoint. Coverage identifies capital intensity, financing costs, competition, and consolidation as sector concerns; these are reported concerns, not quantified issuer-specific outcomes.",
