      "text": "Bull case: the reported Q2 and first-half revenue growth, positive quarterly adjusted EBITDA, and access to a sizable GPU-buildout facility support a credible expansion narrative. Confirmation requires subsequent evidence on delivered capacity, utilization, cash economics, and facility drawdown; current sources do not establish those outcomes.",
