    {
      "text": "Scenario framing: an execution-positive path would be supported by continued reported growth accompanied by evidence of capacity delivery, utilization, and improving cash economics; a constrained path would involve delayed or underused capacity and rising financing burden; a mixed path would show continued revenue growth while operating losses and funding uncertainty persist. These are conditional analytical scenarios, not predictions.",
